# Jordan's job search

Two recruitment agents are now looking for jobs for me. Agents are easy to lose touch with, so each one has a follow-up that repeats: I call Sarah at GreenTalent every Monday, and Dev at Apex Project People every other Wednesday.

Sarah has already put me forward for a role at Tidal Works. The application links to her agency, so I can see which jobs came through which agent.

